    "items": [
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "To the chief Musician on Neginoth, Maschil, A Psalm of David."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Give ear to my prayer, O God;",
          "And hide not thyself from my supplication."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Attend unto me, and hear me:",
          "I mourn in my complaint, and make a noise;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Because of the voice of the enemy,",
          "Because of the oppression of the wicked:",
          "For they cast iniquity upon me,",
          "And in wrath they hate me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "My heart is sore pained within me:",
          "And the terrors of death are fallen upon me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Fearfulness and trembling are come upon me,",
          "And horror hath overwhelmed me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "And I said, Oh that I had wings like a dove!",
          "For then would I fly away, and be at rest."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Lo, then would I wander far off,",
          "And remain in the wilderness."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I would hasten my escape",
          "From the windy storm and tempest."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Destroy, O Lord, and divide their tongues:",
          "For I have seen violence and strife in the city."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Day and night they go about it upon the walls thereof:",
          "Mischief also and sorrow are in the midst of it."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Wickedness is in the midst thereof:",
          "Deceit and guile depart not from her streets."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For it was not an enemy that reproached me;",
          "Then I could have born it:",
          "Neither was it he that hated me that did magnify himself against me;",
          "Then I would have hid myself from him:"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "But it was thou, a man mine equal,",
          "My guide, and mine acquaintance."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "We took sweet counsel together,",
          "And walked unto the house of God in company."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Let death seize upon them, and let them go down quick into hell:",
          "For wickedness is in their dwellings, and among them."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "As for me, I will call upon God;",
          "And the LORD shall save me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Evening, and morning, and at noon, will I pray, and cry aloud:",
          "And he shall hear my voice."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He hath delivered my soul in peace from the battle that was against me:",
          "For there were many with me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "God shall hear, and afflict them, even he that abideth of old."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Because they have no changes, therefore they fear not God."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          20
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He hath put forth his hands against such as be at peace with him:",
          "He hath broken his covenant."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          21
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The words of his mouth were smoother than butter, but war was in his heart:",
          "His words were softer than oil, yet were they drawn swords."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          22
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Cast thy burden upon the LORD, and he shall sustain thee:",
          "He shall never suffer the righteous to be moved."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          23
        ],
        "lines": [
          "But thou,",
          "O God, shalt bring them down into the pit of destruction:",
          "Bloody and deceitful men shall not live out half their days;",
          "But I will trust in thee."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      }
    ]
  },
